:TEST-ID tests.reader.bullet-line-comments
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.reader.bullet-line-comments
:TEST-PURPOSE The bullet character introduces a line comment outside literals.
:TEST-ATOM Inline and whole-line bullet prose is erased without changing strings.
:TEST-EXPECT parse-json
:TEST-TIER regression
:TEST-MENU reader
:TEST-MENU-PATH reader/comments/bullet

module Reader.BulletLineComments []


                    • prose may be aligned beside the declaration it explains
define answer 42    • ignored syntax: (this does not need to balance


define marker "• remains text inside a string"


tests
  assert-eq answer 42 "an inline bullet begins a comment"
  assert-eq marker "• remains text inside a string" "a bullet inside a string remains data"
